      "blocks": {
        "item_FM4iz": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Question",
            "answer": "<p>Answer</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_TJMrn": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Ordering"
          }
        },
        "item_T9Xpa": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I spread the cost with finance?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can split the cost of your order over 3-12 months at no extra cost.<br/><br/>Available finance partners include:<br/><br/>Klarna<br/>Clearpay<br/>PayPal<br/>Shop Pay Installments<br/>DivideBuy (Pay in 6, £300 GBP minimum spend. Pay in 9, £450 GBP minimum spend. Pay in 12, £600 GBP minimum spend).</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_wNVRx": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do I enter Promotional codes?",
            "answer": "<p>You can enter a promotional code on the first checkout page. If the advertised promotional code is set to apply automatically, you don’t need to enter it, this will be applied for you at checkout.<br/><br/>Please note only one promotional code can be applied per order and cannot be used against sale or outlet items unless stated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_gbn7U": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer Trade accounts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, to open a trade account with us please visit our dedicated Trade page www.williamwoodmirrors.co.uk/pages/trade and fill out a Trade application form.</p><p>A member of our Team will be in touch once this is approved with further details.<br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_mJJbc": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "I am interested in a product, but it is sold out, how can I order this?",
            "answer": "<p>If the item you are interested in is sold out, please ensure you have entered your email address in the 'Email Me When Available' section on the product listing page. This way, you will be the first to hear of a restock of your desired William Wood product.</p><p>Due to high demand, we do find that pre-orders may sell out very quickly after we have restocked this; therefore, we recommend acting fast once you receive notification of this.<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_BJ9ef": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do you ensure the quality of your products?",
            "answer": "<p>Quality is at the heart of everything we do. Each product is carefully crafted using high-grade materials by our trusted manufacturers.</p><p>From production to final delivery, we take extra care to ensure every item meets our  standards—so you can be confident you’re receiving a product that is both durable and beautifully finished.<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_PExMq": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Delivery"
          }
        },
        "item_3kXJF": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you charge for delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>Free Delivery is available througout mainland UK.</p><p>Delivery to Northern Ireland is £20.</p><p>Express Delivery is available to some London and North West postcodes, this service is £10.</p><p>Weekend Delivery is available to some London Postcodes, this service is £20.<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_X9BQn": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who do you use for your deliveries?",
            "answer": "<p>We use our own dedicated hand-delivery service rather than third-party couriers. Every one of our drivers is trained to handle products of a fragile nature with the utmost care.<br/><br/>This personal, expert approach ensures your items arrive safely, and it’s a key part of what sets us apart from other companies.<br/><br/>For our smaller items, we occasionally use UPS to provide a reliable, tracked and efficient delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_JyVEj": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will my order be delivered?",
            "answer": "<p>In stock items: Your order will be dispatched within the lead time for your area provided at checkout. Once our logistics team has finalised the delivery schedule, we will provide you with a further update. This will come in the form of a dispatch confirmation email when your order is ready to leave our HQ.<br/><br/>This communication will include the timeframe our driver is covering your area and the driver’s contact details. Please note: the driver will reach out to you via phone or text to provide a more precise time of arrival.<br/><br/>Pre order items: Your pre order will be dispatched from the week displayed<br/>above the ‘PRE-ORDER’ button, in line with the lead time for your area.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_YVFfj": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change my delivery address after I’ve placed my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, please email our Customer Support Team at hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk within 24 hours of placing your order.<br/><br/>We’ll gladly help you change your delivery address (the new address provided must be within our overall area of coverage).</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_GjYfj": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens if I’m not home for my delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>If you're not home for delivery, you may advise your William Wood Delivery driver where to leave your order safe. You can do this using the contact number we provide.<br/><br/>If there's no safe spot, we'll reschedule your delivery for the next available route to your area once your order has returned back to our warehouse. We'll reach out within 24-48 hours to inform you about your first delivery attempt.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_eHy6F": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I check my order when the driver delivers it?",
            "answer": "<p>Our driver will typically be able to allow time for a brief physical condition check on our item(s). Please do ensure this check is quick enough to allow our driver to continue on schedule to his remaining delivery customers.<br/><br/>Please note that our drivers are unable to dispose of any packaging. We strongly recommend keeping all original packaging until you have fully inspected the item(s) and are 100% satisfied with your order.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pwMfV": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will you deliver to my room of choice?",
            "answer": "<p>Your William Wood Dedicated Delivery driver will always deliver to the entrance of the property.<br/><br/>If you request delivery to a room of choice, the driver will assess access on arrival, including stairs, doorways, and tight spaces to determine what can be completed safely. Please note that any room-of-choice delivery is subject to the driver’s discretion on the day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_BDkpY": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>At William Wood, we take a more personal and direct approach to 'tracking'.<br/><br/>We are proud to offer one of the most transparent delivery services in our industry. Our driver will initiate contact via SMS prior to your delivery day. Upon dispatch, you will also be provided your driver's direct contact number, allowing you to contact them if you wish to do so.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kic3j": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I choose a delivery date / time slot?",
            "answer": "<p>We don't offer selected date or timeslot at ccheckout. However, you’ll receive a delivery time window at least the evening prior to delivery. We’ll also provide our driver’s direct contact number so you can coordinate with them at any point if needed.<br/><br/>If you do have specific strict delivery day/time requirements, please advise our customer support team prior to, or immediately upon completion of your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_NgeCY": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I order now and choose a later delivery date?",
            "answer": "<p>Please contact our customer support if you wish to hold delivery of you order - hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</p><p>We are able to hold delivery orders up to 90 days following the date of order. Once we have reached the held date for your order, the delivery will be completed within the leadtime for your area.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_N9fbD": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "I love your products, but there is no delivery option to my country, can you ship to me?",
            "answer": "<p>We are currently working on expanding our website coverage to allow customers from international countries to order our products.<br/><br/>Given the size and fragility of our products, international expansion involves many logistical challenges, and we are currently working through these as quickly as possible.<br/><br/>Please keep up to date with our social channels as we hope to have further news in the near future.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_KN96z": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Help with your order"
          }
        },
        "item_7D6Bq": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is my item(s) on pre-order or in stock?",
            "answer": "<p>All items are in stock and ready to be shipped from William Wood HQ in Knutsford, unless your add to cart button states 'PRE-ORDER'</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_ggXQY": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I amend my order / Pre Order?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, if you need to amend your order, please contact our customer support team at hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk. Our team will be more than happy to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_i9KVq": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "My order has arrived with a defect, what should I do?",
            "answer": "<p>In the rare case your order arrives with a defect, our helpful customer support team are on hand help resolve this - hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk<br/><br/>Please also provide some images of the defect/damage within your enquiry and our team will assist you promptly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_UMBGD": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "I have ordered both pre-order and in stock items, will they be delivered together?",
            "answer": "<p>If your order contains both in-stock and pre-order items, your items will be dispatched as they become available in line with the lead time for your delivery area.<br/></p><p>This means that in-stock items may be delivered separately from pre-order items to avoid unnecessary delays.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_DDx67": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will my free gift be delivered before my pre-order?",
            "answer": "<p>If your order includes a free gift alongside a pre-order item, the free gift will be delivered together with your pre-order once the item becomes available.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_LgYnD": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I exchange my order once it is received?",
            "answer": "<p>Should you wish to exchange your order, this service is free up to 30 days of your order being received. Should the product you wish to exchange to be higher in price than the initial product on your order, the difference in price will be requested by our customer support team. Should the product you wish to exchange to be lower in price than the initial product on your order, an exchange will be carried out.<br/><br/>Once the initial product is returned back to our warehouse, the difference in price will be refunded back to you as soon as possible. Please note your first exchange is free. Any additional exchanges which are not a result of a product being faulty are charged at a fixed fee of £15.00.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_6MpTY": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Product Information and Warranty"
          }
        },
        "item_9jwbM": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer a warranty on your products?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, every product is covered by our 1-year warranty. For more information on our warranty, please see here www.williamwoodmirrors.co.uk/pages/warranty</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_zaDbH": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I request more images of a product?",
            "answer": "<p>All images on our website are taken by our in-house photography team, who aim to represent each product as accurately as possible.<br/><br/>We unfortunately do not have more pictures of the items beyond those already shown on our website.</p><p>For further inspiration, please check our socials - @williamwood</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_rQBUi": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I use to hang my mirror?",
            "answer": "<p>The fittings required for wall mounting will depend on your wall type. For solid walls, a pair of standard 2-3\" screws drilled directly into the wall with wall plugs will be sufficient for the mirror to hang in place as required.</p><p>You may require additional fittings to wall-mount heavier items if you have a non-solid wall type. We recommend a product called 'Gripit'; these will allow you to wall-mount items far in excess of the weight of our mirrors into non-solid walls.<br/><br/>Please ensure you do not use wire to hang to hang your mirror as this will cause immediate damage to your item(s) and will void your warranty.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_qAWDg": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does my order arrive assembled?",
            "answer": "<p>Furniture items that require assembly will be clearly stated within the product description on the product page.</p><p>If assembly is required, any relevant information or instructions for the product will be provided in the box upon delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_EBe6F": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer a fitting/assembly service?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, once your order is confirmed you will receive a confirmation email. This email will have a link to schedule your fitting or assembly service with our trusted partner, TaskRabbit.<br/><br/>Please ensure you do not book this service until you have taken delivery of your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_CFhYx": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are your products made from?",
            "answer": "<p>We use a variety of different premium materials to produce different products within our range. Each product that we sell is produced by trusted and vetted suppliers. To find out what specific products are made from, head to the product information section on the product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_jyiYq": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Our Brand"
          }
        },
        "item_Ff4Qp": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I trust William Wood?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Yes</strong>, you can fully trust William Wood. Since 2010, we’ve welcomed over 700,000 customers. We have more than 30,000 five-star product reviews, have a 4.7 rating on Trustpilot and our social media community has a total following of over 840,000. If you ever need us, our team is on hand before, during, and after your order to make sure everything runs smoothly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_ydtRD": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you have a shop?",
            "answer": "<p>Not just yet, we are working to open our first location in 2026. Become an Email Member to be the first to know.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_eG43j": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Returns and Refunds"
          }
        },
        "item_dLjPf": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I cancel my order / Pre Order?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, if you need to cancel your order at any point, please contact our customer support team - hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</p><p>Our team will be more than happy to assist you.<br/><br/>Please note if you do cancel after your order has been dispatched the refund will be processed once the item(s) have returned to our warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_WirMQ": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "I would like to return my order; how do I do this?",
            "answer": "<p>If an item doesn't fit your space or meet your requirements, please let us know within 30 days of receiving your order.</p><p>Our team will arrange to collect it from your delivery address. You won’t need to return anything yourself.</p><p>Please keep your packaging until you have confirmed you are 100% happy with your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_fhUaU": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you charge for a return?",
            "answer": "<p>There is a £15 carriage fee for return of item(s) up to the value of £499 RRP</p><p>There is a £25 carriage fee for return of item(s) over the value of £500 RRP<br/><br/>Please note this charge is applied per visit and will be deducted from your refund on the return of your item(s).</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_waCyy": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "I have ordered as part of a bundle; will this affect my refund?",
            "answer": "<p>If you return part of an order that was placed using a multi-item bundle discount, the remaining items in your order will be re-evaluated under the relevant offer tier.<br/><br/>For example: If a “30% off three or more full priced items” promotion was used, and one item is returned, the remaining two items will be adjusted to the “20% off two full priced items” pricing.<br/><br/>The price difference will be deducted from your refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_cyd9K": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I receive my refund?",
            "answer": "<p>Once collected, your item(s) will be returned to our warehouse.</p><p>When we receive them, we’ll refund you within 1-3 Business Days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_nTP74": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "question": "I don’t have the packaging for my return, is there a charge?",
            "answer": "<p>Should you no longer have the packaging for your item(s), this would incur a repackaging charge, that would be deducted from your refund. This is applied per item.<br/><br/>Items under £99 RRP (including free gifts): £10 fee applies<br/><br/>Items £100 - £499 RRP: £15 fee applies<br/><br/>Items £500 RRP and over: £25 fee applies<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
