          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-customer-support",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Icon_Return.svg",
            "custom_icon_width": 40,
            "title": "Worried about how to return?",
            "content": "<p>We've made returning your William Wood order effortless.<br/><br/>Returns are 100% <strong>Free </strong>if you let us know you wish to return within <strong>90 days</strong> of receiving your order.<br/><br/>Contact our Customer Support Team stating you wish to return, <strong>we'll collect it from you for Free</strong>. No need for you to return your William Wood order yourself.<br/><br/>Once your order arrives back to the William Wood HQ, <strong>100% of your funds</strong> will be refunded within 1-3 Business Days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_XQLFt": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-box",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Icon_Damage.svg",
            "custom_icon_width": 40,
            "title": "Worried your William Wood order will arrive damaged?",
            "content": "<p>Rest assured, in the rare case your order arrives damaged, William Wood will replace item(s) in your order completely free of charge.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_zchAd": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-phone",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Icon_Poor_Qual.svg",
            "custom_icon_width": 40,
            "title": "Worried about the quality of William Wood products?",
            "content": "<p>There are no shortcuts in our design process. Every William Wood product is built to last - That's our promise to you.<br/><br/>If the product that you receive is not for you, you won't pay anything. Every order is backed by our 100% money-back guarantee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Rp6dM": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-lock",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Icon_Colour.svg",
            "custom_icon_width": 40,
            "title": "Worried that the colour may not match our product photography?",
            "content": "<p>Our product photography represents the exact finish you will receive. If you receive your William Wood order and the colour not be to your taste, you are fully backed by our 100% money-back guarantee. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
